1f:["$","section","1-Work backwards from the result or document the programme needs",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Work backwards from the result or document the programme needs"}],[["$","p","A programme deadline does not tell you when to start every supporting task. Check whether the university uses a standard uni-assist application, a VPD to submit later to the university, or direct submission. The receiving university determines which record must arrive by its deadline.",{"children":"A programme deadline does not tell you when to start every supporting task. Check whether the university uses a standard uni-assist application, a VPD to submit later to the university, or direct submission. The receiving university determines which record must arrive by its deadline."}],["$","p","If your route includes Studienkolleg or TestAS, give those steps their own dates. TestAS publishes result availability separately from the test date; a sitting before the deadline may still produce results too late. A preparatory-course application can also have a different calendar from the later bachelor’s degree.",{"children":"If your route includes Studienkolleg or TestAS, give those steps their own dates. TestAS publishes result availability separately from the test date; a sitting before the deadline may still produce results too late. A preparatory-course application can also have a different calendar from the later bachelor’s degree."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Build the timing chain for your actual application","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Build the timing chain for your actual application"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Task",{"scope":"col","children":"Task"}],["$","th","Who controls the requirement",{"scope":"col","children":"Who controls the requirement"}],["$","th","Evidence to record",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence to record"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Programme admission"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Receiving university"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Current course call and applicant category"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"VPD or standard evaluation"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"University instructions plus uni-assist route"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Required submission and processing stages"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Studienkolleg"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Provider and receiving institution"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Preparation intake and entrance assessment"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"TestAS"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Test provider and receiving programme"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Test date, result release and upload deadline"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Work backwards from the result or document the programme needs","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/vpd-germany/",{"href":"/guides/vpd-germany/","children":["VPD explained",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/uni-assist-application/",{"href":"/guides/uni-assist-application/","children":["uni-assist application",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-a